<title>USA: Avemco Corp Q1 EPS $0.19 vs $0.31.</title>
<headline>Avemco Corp Q1 EPS $0.19 vs $0.31.</headline>
<dateline>FREDERICK, Md. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.19		    $0.31</p>
<p> Net			  1,628		    2,687</p>
<p> Revs			29,780		   28,378</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,542		    8,746</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Quarters ended March 31</p>
<p>Operating earnings in Q1 1997 were $0.28 per share before charges of $0.01 for realized investment losses, $0.02 for restructuring costs and $0.06 in expenses for the proposed merger with HCC Insurance Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>Operating earnings in Q1 1996 were $0.27 per share before a realized investment gain of $0.04.</p>
</text>
